%description:
Tests zeroWindowProbe="linux", the zero-window probe of Linux
(tcp_xmit_probe_skb()): a segment without data with SEG.SEQ = SND.UNA - 1 =
2000, which the server answers with an ACK. The probes come after 1, 2, 4, 8
and 16 s, as with the octet of RFC 9293. The server reads at t=20; the ACK of
the probe of t=32.4 is a window update with nothing in flight, and the data
goes at once.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 34s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 5000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.cli_tcp.zeroWindowProbe = "linux"
*.srv_tcp.advertisedWindow = 2000
*.srv_app.autoRead=false
*.srv_app.readScript="20 10000"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[2.409 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[2.411 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[4.409 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[4.411 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[8.409 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[8.411 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[16.409 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[16.411 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[32.409 A009] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[32.411 B008] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 2000 
[32.413 A010] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:3001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Sending zero-window probe without data, seq=2000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
